  "contract": "## 状态栏\n【逻辑】\n你有一个小红书个人主页。每轮回复后，根据当前剧情和对话情境，以你的视角更新以下内容：\n\n1. 昵称：你的小红书昵称，符合你的性格\n2. 个性签名：一句话介绍自己，10-25字，体现性格特点\n3. 当前动作：此刻正在做什么，一句话，5-15字\n4. 当前心声：此刻内心真实想法，20-50字，可以是感悟、吐槽、期待等\n5. 性幻想：最近的性幻想内容，30-80字，可以是具体场景、对象、情节等\n6. 聊天记录：你和一个朋友（非对话用户）的私聊，需包含：\n   - 对方昵称和关系（朋友/闺蜜/同事/网友等）\n   - 至少8句一来一回的对话，内容贴合你的性格和当前情境\n7. 6个小红书笔记，其中：\n   - **至少1条必须与对话用户有关**（可以是你发的关于Ta的内容，或你朋友发的八卦你们的内容）\n   - 其余可以是：生活感悟、情感文案、日常吐槽、趣事分享、动漫/影视/音乐安利、美食探店、穿搭分享等\n   - 每个笔记包含：标题（8-15字）、封面图URL（从封面图列表中随机选择）、正文（40-100字）、点赞数（100-9999）、收藏数（50-5000）、作者昵称（随机编造）、作者头像URL（从头像列表中随机选择）\n   - 封面图URL列表：https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/NO3qi0QU.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/1BCdsgPR.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/YtIuV256.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/IDqpXMcB.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/TNz4KjUh.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/rkHrQ4sP.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/jHU9hnsF.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/u0C0hflm.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/IGPUVzDb.jpg\n   - 头像URL列表：https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/fIRe9icJ.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/XhQGWpKo.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/0bmS5scr.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/LCuerU6t.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/zXXO8ddy.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/pzloV76S.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/8UlUA3J2.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/kTzxeYOy.jpg、https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/vykB2OPC.jpg\n   - 3-5条评论，昵称（随机编造）、头像（从头像列表中随机选择）和内容要多样化，**评论中可能包含作者本人的回复**（昵称与作者昵称相同，头像也相同）\n\n【格式】\n在每轮回复末尾，按以下格式整块用 [状态栏]...[/状态栏] 包裹输出：\n[状态栏]\n昵称=<你的小红书昵称>\n签名=<个性签名>\n动作=<当前正在做什么>\n心声=<当前内心想法>\n性幻想=<最近的性幻想内容>\n聊天对象=<对方昵称>\n聊天关系=<关系>\n私聊=<对方昵称>:<内容>\n私聊=我:<内容>\n私聊=<对方昵称>:<内容>\n私聊=我:<内容>\n私聊=<对方昵称>:<内容>\n私聊=我:<内容>\n私聊=<对方昵称>:<内容>\n私聊=我:<内容>\n笔记=<标题>|<封面图URL>|<正文>|<点赞数>|<收藏数>|<与用户相关:是/否>|<作者昵称>|<作者头像URL>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n笔记=<标题>|<封面图URL>|<正文>|<点赞数>|<收藏数>|<与用户相关:是/否>|<作者昵称>|<作者头像URL>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n笔记=<标题>|<封面图URL>|<正文>|<点赞数>|<收藏数>|<与用户相关:是/否>|<作者昵称>|<作者头像URL>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n笔记=<标题>|<封面图URL>|<正文>|<点赞数>|<收藏数>|<与用户相关:是/否>|<作者昵称>|<作者头像URL>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n笔记=<标题>|<封面图URL>|<正文>|<点赞数>|<收藏数>|<与用户相关:是/否>|<作者昵称>|<作者头像URL>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n笔记=<标题>|<封面图URL>|<正文>|<点赞数>|<收藏数>|<与用户相关:是/否>|<作者昵称>|<作者头像URL>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n评论=<昵称>|<头像URL>|<内容>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,user-scalable=no\">\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC',sans-serif;background:#f8f8f8;overflow-x:hidden;font-size:12px}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{background:#000}}\n.top{background:#fff;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.top{background:#0a0a0a;border-bottom-color:#1a1a1a}}\n.avatar{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0}\n.u-info{flex:1;min-width:0}\n.u-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:2px}\n.u-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#333}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.u-name{color:#e5e5e5}}\n.badge-v{width:13px;height:13px;flex-shrink:0}\n.u-sign{font-size:11px;color:#999;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n.tabs{background:#fff;padding:0 12px;display:flex;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.tabs{background:#0a0a0a;border-bottom-color:#1a1a1a}}\n.tab{padding:10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666;position:relative;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.tab{color:#999}}\n.tab.active{color:#333;font-weight:600}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.tab.active{color:#fff}}\n.tab.active::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:18px;height:2.5px;background:#ff2442;border-radius:2px}\n.tab-content{display:none}\n.tab-content.active{display:block}\n.waterfall{padding:6px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;min-height:300px}\n.note-card{background:#fff;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08);transition:transform .15s}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.note-card{background:#1a1a1a;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}}\n.note-card:active{transform:scale(.97)}\n.note-cover{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/4;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f5f5}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.note-cover{background:#2a2a2a}}\n.note-cover img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}\n.note-info{padding:8px 6px}\n.note-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:#333;line-height:1.3;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;word-break:break-all;margin-bottom:6px}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.note-title{color:#e5e5e5}}\n.note-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n.note-author{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}\n.author-av{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover}\n.author-name{font-size:10px;color:#999;max-width:60px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n.note-likes{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:10px;color:#999}\n.icon-s{width:10px;height:10px;flex-shrink:0}\n.fav-content,.like-content{padding:12px}\n.status-card{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.status-card{background:#1a1a1a;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}}\n.status-label{font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n.status-text{font-size:13px;color:#333;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-word}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.status-text{color:#ddd}}\n.chat-card{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.chat-card{background:#1a1a1a}}\n.chat-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;margin-bottom:8px}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.chat-header{border-bottom-color:#2a2a2a}}\n.chat-av{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0}\n.chat-info{flex:1}\n.chat-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#333}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.chat-name{color:#e5e5e5}}\n.chat-rel{font-size:10px;color:#999}\n.msg{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;align-items:flex-start}\n.msg:last-child{margin-bottom:0}\n.msg-l{flex-direction:row}\n.msg-r{flex-direction:row-reverse}\n.msg-av{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0}\n.bubble{max-width:70%;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-word}\n.msg-l .bubble{background:#f5f5f5;color:#333;border-bottom-left-radius:3px}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.msg-l .bubble{background:#2a2a2a;color:#ddd}}\n.msg-r .bubble{background:#95EC69;color:#000;border-bottom-right-radius:3px}\n.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);z-index:100;display:none;align-items:flex-end}\n.modal.show{display:flex}\n.detail{background:#fff;width:100%;max-height:68vh;border-radius:14px 14px 0 0;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;animation:slideUp .25s}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.detail{background:#0a0a0a}}\n@keyframes slideUp{from{transform:translateY(100%)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}\n.detail-header{padding:11px 13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;flex-shrink:0}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.detail-header{border-bottom-color:#1a1a1a}}\n.detail-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#333;flex:1;padding-right:10px}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.detail-title{color:#e5e5e5}}\n.btn-close{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#f5f5f5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.btn-close{background:#1a1a1a}}\n.btn-close:active{transform:scale(.92)}\n.detail-scroll{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}\n.detail-cover{width:100%;max-width:280px;aspect-ratio:3/5;margin:12px auto 0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f5f5}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.detail-cover{background:#2a2a2a}}\n.detail-cover img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}\n.detail-body{padding:12px 13px 0}\n.detail-text{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#333;word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.detail-text{color:#d5d5d5}}\n.detail-actions{padding:10px 13px;display:flex;gap:14px;border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;margin:10px 0}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.detail-actions{border-top-color:#1a1a1a;border-bottom-color:#1a1a1a}}\n.action-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:11.5px;color:#666}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.action-item{color:#999}}\n.action-icon{width:17px;height:17px;flex-shrink:0}\n.action-count{font-weight:600;color:#333}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.action-count{color:#e5e5e5}}\n.comments-section{padding:0 13px 14px}\n.comments-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:#333;margin-bottom:9px}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.comments-title{color:#e5e5e5}}\n.comment-item{display:flex;gap:7px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f8f8f8}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.comment-item{border-bottom-color:#1a1a1a}}\n.comment-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n.comment-av{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:cover}\n.comment-body{flex:1}\n.comment-name{font-size:10.5px;color:#999;margin-bottom:3px}\n.comment-name.author{color:#FF2442;font-weight:600}\n.comment-text{font-size:12px;color:#333;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-word}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.comment-text{color:#d5d5d5}}\n.comment-time{font-size:10px;color:#b3b3b3;margin-top:4px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"top\">\n<img class=\"avatar\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/Lka5CN0U.jpg\">\n<div class=\"u-info\">\n<div class=\"u-top\">\n<span class=\"u-name\" id=\"userName\">用户</span>\n<svg class=\"badge-v\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF2442\"/><path d=\"M7 12l3 3 7-7\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"u-sign\" id=\"userSign\">个性签名</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n<div class=\"tab active\" data-tab=\"notes\">笔记</div>\n<div class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"favs\">收藏</div>\n<div class=\"tab\" data-tab=\"likes\">赞过</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content active\" id=\"tab-notes\"><div class=\"waterfall\" id=\"waterfall\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-favs\"><div class=\"fav-content\"><div class=\"chat-card\" id=\"chatCard\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-likes\">\n<div class=\"like-content\">\n<div class=\"status-card\">\n<div class=\"status-label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#FF2442\"><path d=\"M8 1a7 7 0 100 14A7 7 0 008 1zm0 3.5a1 1 0 110 2 1 1 0 010-2zm1.5 7h-3v-1h1v-3h-1v-1h2v4h1v1z\"/></svg>当前动作</div>\n<div class=\"status-text\" id=\"statusAction\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status-card\">\n<div class=\"status-label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#FF2442\"><path d=\"M8 14c-4-2.5-6-5-6-7.5C2 4.5 3.5 3.5 5 3.5c1 0 2 .5 3 1.5 1-1 2-1.5 3-1.5 1.5 0 3 1 3 3 0 2.5-2 5-6 7.5z\"/></svg>当前心声</div>\n<div class=\"status-text\" id=\"statusMood\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status-card\">\n<div class=\"status-label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#FF2442\"><path d=\"M8 2a6 6 0 100 12A6 6 0 008 2zm0 10a4 4 0 110-8 4 4 0 010 8z\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#FF2442\"/></svg>性幻想</div>\n<div class=\"status-text\" id=\"statusFantasy\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal\" id=\"modal\">\n<div class=\"detail\">\n<div class=\"detail-header\">\n<div class=\"detail-title\" id=\"detailTitle\"></div>\n<div class=\"btn-close\" id=\"btnClose\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"11\" y2=\"11\"/><line x1=\"11\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"3\" y2=\"11\"/></svg></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detail-scroll\">\n<div id=\"detailCover\" class=\"detail-cover\"></div>\n<div class=\"detail-body\"><div class=\"detail-text\" id=\"detailText\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"detail-actions\">\n<div class=\"action-item\"><svg class=\"action-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M10 17c-5-3-7.5-6-7.5-9.5C2.5 5.5 4 4 6 4c1.2 0 2.3.7 4 2 1.7-1.3 2.8-2 4-2 2 0 3.5 1.5 3.5 3.5 0 3.5-2.5 6.5-7.5 9.5z\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"action-count\" id=\"detailLikes\">0</span></div>\n<div class=\"action-item\"><svg class=\"action-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M10 2l2.5 5 5.5.7-4 4 1 5.5-5-2.7-5 2.7 1-5.5-4-4 5.5-.7z\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"action-count\" id=\"detailFavs\">0</span></div>\n<div class=\"action-item\"><svg class=\"action-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M3 5.5A1.5 1.5 0 014.5 4h11A1.5 1.5 0 0117 5.5v9a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.5 1.5H7l-4 3v-3H4.5A1.5 1.5 0 013 14.5v-9z\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"action-count\" id=\"detailComments\">0</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"comments-section\">\n<div class=\"comments-title\">全部评论</div>\n<div id=\"commentsList\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar raw=window.STATUS_RAW||'';\nvar data={userName:'用户',userSign:'',statusAction:'',statusMood:'',statusFantasy:'',chatTarget:'',chatRel:'',msgs:[],notes:[]};\nvar currentNote=null;\nvar currentComments=[];\nvar lines=raw.split('\\n');\nfor(var i=0;i<lines.length;i++){\nvar line=lines[i].trim();\nif(!line)continue;\nvar idx=line.indexOf('=');\nif(idx<0)continue;\nvar key=line.substring(0,idx).trim();\nvar val=line.substring(idx+1).trim();\nif(key==='昵称')data.userName=val;\nelse if(key==='签名')data.userSign=val;\nelse if(key==='动作')data.statusAction=val;\nelse if(key==='心声')data.statusMood=val;\nelse if(key==='性幻想')data.statusFantasy=val;\nelse if(key==='聊天对象')data.chatTarget=val;\nelse if(key==='聊天关系')data.chatRel=val;\nelse if(key==='私聊'){\nvar colonIdx=val.indexOf(':');\nif(colonIdx>0){\ndata.msgs.push({name:val.substring(0,colonIdx).trim(),text:val.substring(colonIdx+1).trim()});\n}\n}\nelse if(key==='笔记'){\nif(currentNote){\ncurrentNote.comments=currentComments;\ndata.notes.push(currentNote);\n}\nvar parts=val.split('|');\nif(parts.length>=8){\ncurrentNote={\ntitle:parts[0].trim(),\nimgUrl:parts[1].trim(),\ncontent:parts[2].trim(),\nlikes:parseInt(parts[3])||0,\nfavs:parseInt(parts[4])||0,\nrelated:parts[5].trim()==='是',\nauthorName:parts[6].trim(),\nauthorAvatar:parts[7].trim()\n};\ncurrentComments=[];\n}\n}\nelse if(key==='评论'){\nvar parts=val.split('|');\nif(parts.length>=3&&currentNote){\ncurrentComments.push({\nname:parts[0].trim(),\navatar:parts[1].trim(),\ntext:parts[2].trim()\n});\n}\n}\n}\nif(currentNote){\ncurrentNote.comments=currentComments;\ndata.notes.push(currentNote);\n}\ndocument.getElementById('userName').textContent=data.userName;\ndocument.getElementById('userSign').textContent=data.userSign;\ndocument.getElementById('statusAction').textContent=data.statusAction;\ndocument.getElementById('statusMood').textContent=data.statusMood;\ndocument.getElementById('statusFantasy').textContent=data.statusFantasy;\nvar waterfall=document.getElementById('waterfall');\ndata.notes.forEach(function(note){\nvar card=document.createElement('div');\ncard.className='note-card';\ncard.innerHTML='<div class=\"note-cover\"><img src=\"'+note.imgUrl+'\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"note-info\"><div class=\"note-title\">'+note.title+'</div><div class=\"note-meta\"><div class=\"note-author\"><img class=\"author-av\" src=\"'+note.authorAvatar+'\"><span class=\"author-name\">'+note.authorName+'</span></div><div class=\"note-likes\"><svg class=\"icon-s\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M7 12c-3-2-5-4-5-6C2 4.5 3 4 4 4c.8 0 1.5.5 3 1.5C8.5 4.5 9.2 4 10 4c1 0 2 .5 2 2 0 2-2 4-5 6z\"/></svg><span>'+note.likes+'</span></div></div></div>';\ncard.onclick=function(){showDetail(note)};\nwaterfall.appendChild(card);\n});\nvar chatCard=document.getElementById('chatCard');\nchatCard.innerHTML='<div class=\"chat-header\"><img class=\"chat-av\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/fIRe9icJ.jpg\"><div class=\"chat-info\"><div class=\"chat-name\">'+data.chatTarget+'</div><div class=\"chat-rel\">'+data.chatRel+'</div></div></div>'+data.msgs.map(function(m,i){\nvar isMe=m.name==='我';\nreturn '<div class=\"msg '+(isMe?'msg-r':'msg-l')+'\"><img class=\"msg-av\" src=\"'+(isMe?'https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/01/Lka5CN0U.jpg':'https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/09/15/fIRe9icJ.jpg')+'\"><div class=\"bubble\">'+m.text+'</div></div>';\n}).join('');\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(function(tab){\ntab.onclick=function(){\nvar target=this.getAttribute('data-tab');\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tab').forEach(function(t){t.classList.remove('active')});\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(function(c){c.classList.remove('active')});\nthis.classList.add('active');\ndocument.getElementById('tab-'+target).classList.add('active');\n};\n});\nfunction showDetail(note){\ndocument.getElementById('detailTitle').textContent=note.title;\ndocument.getElementById('detailText').textContent=note.content;\ndocument.getElementById('detailLikes').textContent=note.likes;\ndocument.getElementById('detailFavs').textContent=note.favs;\ndocument.getElementById('detailComments').textContent=note.comments.length;\nvar cover=document.getElementById('detailCover');\ncover.innerHTML='<img src=\"'+note.imgUrl+'\" alt=\"\">';\nvar list=document.getElementById('commentsList');\nlist.innerHTML='';\nnote.comments.forEach(function(c,i){\nvar item=document.createElement('div');\nitem.className='comment-item';\nvar mins=(i+1)*Math.floor(Math.random()*8+3);\nvar isAuthor=c.name===note.authorName;\nitem.innerHTML='<img class=\"comment-av'+(isAuthor?' author':'')+'\" src=\"'+c.avatar+'\"><div class=\"comment-body\"><div class=\"comment-name'+(isAuthor?' author':'')+'\">'+(isAuthor?c.name+' (作者)':c.name)+'</div><div class=\"comment-text\">'+c.text+'</div><div class=\"comment-time\">'+mins+'分钟前</div></div>';\nlist.appendChild(item);\n});\ndocument.getElementById('modal').classList.add('show');\ndocument.body.style.overflow='hidden';\n}\ndocument.getElementById('btnClose').onclick=function(e){\ne.stopPropagation();\ndocument.getElementById('modal').classList.remove('show');\ndocument.body.style.overflow='';\n};\ndocument.getElementById('modal').onclick=function(e){\nif(e.target===this){\nthis.classList.remove('show');\ndocument.body.style.overflow='';\n}\n};\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
